<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="21157332"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="319744993"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="One Day"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Matisyahu"/><amll:meta key="album" value="One Day"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:27.573"><div begin="00:07.110" end="03:18.339"><p begin="00:07.110" end="00:13.229" itunes:key="L1">(One day, one day, one day)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总有一天 总有一天 总有一天</span></p><p begin="00:14.282" end="00:15.687" itunes:key="L2">Sometimes, I lay<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有时候 我徜徉在月光之下 感谢上帝 我仍呼吸自如</span></p><p begin="00:15.977" end="00:17.538" itunes:key="L3">Under the moon<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">（躺）在月光下</span></p><p begin="00:17.858" end="00:20.423" itunes:key="L4">And thank God I'm breathin'<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感谢上帝让我还继续呼吸着</span></p><p begin="00:21.107" end="00:22.367" itunes:key="L5">Then I pray<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我祈祷上帝 别那么快将我带走 因为我留在这里是有原因的</span></p><p begin="00:22.558" end="00:24.096" itunes:key="L6">Don't take me soon<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">别这么快把我带走</span></p><p begin="00:24.226" end="00:26.815" itunes:key="L7">'Cause I am here for a reason<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我留在这是有原因的</span></p><p begin="00:26.825" end="00:29.148" itunes:key="L8">Sometimes, in my tears I drown<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有时候 我沉溺在自己的眼泪里</span></p><p begin="00:29.816" end="00:32.498" itunes:key="L9">But I never let it get me down<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我从来不会一蹶不振</span></p><p begin="00:33.075" end="00:35.925" itunes:key="L10">So, when negativity surrounds<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以 当消极情绪包围着我</span></p><p begin="00:36.411" end="00:40.174" itunes:key="L11">I know some day, it'll all turn around because<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我知道总有一天 一切都会好转 因为</span></p><p begin="00:40.184" end="00:42.685" itunes:key="L12">All my life I've been waiting for<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我穷尽一生在等待 我一直在虔诚祈祷</span></p><p begin="00:43.057" end="00:44.334" itunes:key="L13">I've been prayin' for<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我一直为之祈祷的</span></p><p begin="00:44.659" end="00:46.797" itunes:key="L14">For the people to say<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就如人们期待的一般</span></p><p begin="00:46.807" end="00:49.297" itunes:key="L15">That we don't wanna fight no more<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们再也不想卷入纷争 这个世界再也不会战火纷飞</span></p><p begin="00:49.657" end="00:51.021" itunes:key="L16">There'll be no more wars<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再也没有战争了</span></p><p begin="00:51.311" end="00:53.371" itunes:key="L17">And our children will play<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的孩子会自由嬉戏</span></p><p begin="00:53.381" end="00:55.859" itunes:key="L18">One day (One day)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总有一天</span></p><p begin="00:55.064" end="00:57.351" itunes:key="L19">One day (One day)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总有一天</span></p><p begin="00:56.686" end="01:00.029" itunes:key="L20">One day, oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总有一天</span></p><p begin="01:00.039" end="01:02.111" itunes:key="L21">One day (One day)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总有一天</span></p><p begin="01:01.658" end="01:03.771" itunes:key="L22">One day (One day)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总有一天</span></p><p begin="01:03.317" end="01:06.666" itunes:key="L23">One day, oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总有一天</span></p><p begin="01:07.287" end="01:08.668" itunes:key="L24">It's not about<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们不再在乎输赢 因为当无辜的灵魂为之牺牲 鲜血洒满道路</span></p><p begin="01:09.098" end="01:10.537" itunes:key="L25">Win or lose<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">赢或者输</span></p><p begin="01:10.647" end="01:12.046" itunes:key="L26">'Cause we all lose<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们都输了</span></p><p begin="01:12.056" end="01:14.826" itunes:key="L27">When they feed on the souls of the innocent<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们都一败涂地</span></p><p begin="01:14.936" end="01:16.447" itunes:key="L28">Blood-drenched pavement<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">鲜血淋湿道路</span></p><p begin="01:16.609" end="01:19.917" itunes:key="L29">Keep on movin', though the waters stay raging<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">继续前行 越过咆哮的河水</span></p><p begin="01:20.730" end="01:25.686" itunes:key="L30">In this maze, you can lose your way (Your way)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这个迷宫里 你会迷失方向</span></p><p begin="01:25.930" end="01:27.746" itunes:key="L31">It might drive you crazy<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也许这会让你陷入疯狂 但不要被影响</span></p><p begin="01:27.756" end="01:31.604" itunes:key="L32">But don't let it faze you, no way (No way)</p><p begin="01:32.997" end="01:36.469" itunes:key="L33">Sometimes, in my tears I drown (I drown)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有时候 我沉溺在自己的眼泪里</span></p><p begin="01:36.068" end="01:39.811" itunes:key="L34">But I never let it get me down (Get me down)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">沉溺</span></p><p begin="01:39.221" end="01:43.052" itunes:key="L35">So, when negativity surrounds (Surrounds)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一蹶不振</span></p><p begin="01:42.698" end="01:46.373" itunes:key="L36">I know some day, it'll all turn around because<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">包围着我</span></p><p begin="01:46.383" end="01:49.769" itunes:key="L37">All my life I've been waitin' for (Waitin' for)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我穷尽一生在等待</span></p><p begin="01:49.262" end="01:51.380" itunes:key="L38">I've been prayin' for (Prayin' for)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一直等待</span></p><p begin="01:50.893" end="01:53.001" itunes:key="L39">For the people to say<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虔诚祈祷</span></p><p begin="01:53.011" end="01:56.389" itunes:key="L40">That we don't wanna fight no more (Fight no more)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们再也不想卷入纷争</span></p><p begin="01:55.890" end="01:59.122" itunes:key="L41">There will be no more wars (No more wars)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不再卷入纷争</span></p><p begin="01:57.578" end="01:59.562" itunes:key="L42">And our children will play<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">战火不再纷飞</span></p><p begin="01:59.572" end="02:01.704" itunes:key="L43">One day (One day)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总有一天</span></p><p begin="02:01.278" end="02:03.409" itunes:key="L44">One day (One day)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总有一天</span></p><p begin="02:02.874" end="02:05.085" itunes:key="L45">One day, oh (One day)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总有一天</span></p><p begin="02:06.262" end="02:08.383" itunes:key="L46">One day (One day)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总有一天</span></p><p begin="02:07.916" end="02:10.029" itunes:key="L47">One day (One day)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总有一天</span></p><p begin="02:09.547" end="02:12.827" itunes:key="L48">One day, oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总有一天</span></p><p begin="02:12.646" end="02:14.255" itunes:key="L49">One day, this all will change<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总有一天 一切都会改变 对所有人一视同仁</span></p><p begin="02:14.265" end="02:15.867" itunes:key="L50">Treat people the same<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对所有人一视同仁</span></p><p begin="02:15.999" end="02:17.778" itunes:key="L51">Stop with the violence<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">停止一切暴力 放下仇恨</span></p><p begin="02:17.788" end="02:19.338" itunes:key="L52">Down with the hate<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不再有仇恨</span></p><p begin="02:19.348" end="02:20.916" itunes:key="L53">One day, we'll all be free<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总有一天 我们都会获得自由</span></p><p begin="02:21.135" end="02:22.453" itunes:key="L54">And proud to be<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都会骄傲</span></p><p begin="02:22.825" end="02:24.380" itunes:key="L55">Under the same sun<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在同样的阳光下 我们都满怀骄傲 高唱自由</span></p><p begin="02:24.390" end="02:26.075" itunes:key="L56">Singing songs of freedom like<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唱着自由的歌就像</span></p><p begin="02:25.858" end="02:32.511" itunes:key="L57">Woo-yoo, woo-yoo, oh (One day, one day)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何 为何</span></p><p begin="02:32.521" end="02:39.330" itunes:key="L58">Woo-yoo, woo-yoo, oh (One day, one day)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何 为何</span></p><p begin="02:39.340" end="02:41.861" itunes:key="L65">All my life I've been waitin' for<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我穷尽一生在等待</span></p><p begin="02:42.244" end="02:43.497" itunes:key="L66">I've been prayin' for<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我一直在虔诚祈祷</span></p><p begin="02:43.846" end="02:45.959" itunes:key="L67">For the people to say<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就如人们期待的一般</span></p><p begin="02:45.969" end="02:48.466" itunes:key="L68">That we don't wanna fight no more<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们再也不想卷入纷争</span></p><p begin="02:48.797" end="02:50.190" itunes:key="L69">There'll be no more wars<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这个世界再也不会战火纷飞</span></p><p begin="02:50.497" end="02:52.558" itunes:key="L70">And our children will play<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的孩子会自由嬉戏</span></p><p begin="02:52.568" end="02:54.677" itunes:key="L71">One day (One day)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何 为何</span></p><p begin="02:54.248" end="02:56.329" itunes:key="L72">One day (One day)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总有一天</span></p><p begin="02:55.879" end="02:59.177" itunes:key="L73">One day, oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总有一天</span></p><p begin="02:59.187" end="03:01.277" itunes:key="L74">One day (One day)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何 为何</span></p><p begin="03:00.858" end="03:02.948" itunes:key="L75">One day (One day)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总有一天</span></p><p begin="03:02.468" end="03:05.818" itunes:key="L76">One day, oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总有一天</span></p><p begin="03:12.465" end="03:18.339" itunes:key="L77">(One day, one day, one day)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总有一天 总有一天 总有一天</span></p></div></body></tt>